    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Oranges used to cost $\\$2.80$ per kg, but the price has increased by $5\\%$, $10\\%$ and $12\\%$ in three successive years. Multiply by $1.05\\times1.1\\times1.12$ to find their price now. Give your answer to the nearest cent.",
